        <dc:creator>Anonymous (anonymous@undisclosed.example.com)</dc:creator>
        <title>bugs:start</title>
        <link>https://urmp.org/bugs/start?rev=1246467937&amp;do=diff</link>
        <description>Known Bugs

	*  Error when using -b on an empty directory
	*  Ability to link directories into loop
	*  -b should take a filename as well as a directory
	*  dbsplit --help doesn't work
	*  CFLAGS=-g ./configure doesn't work
	*  -b will hang if a process dies unexpectedly</description>
    </item>
